<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?><transcript><text start="1.36" dur="5.439">We have Halloween</text><text start="3.76" dur="4.799">at the White House in a little while and</text><text start="6.799" dur="3.76">I think Air Force One is going to do a</text><text start="8.559" dur="5.521">flyover which will be exciting for the</text><text start="10.559" dur="5.521">kids. We have a tremendous number of</text><text start="14.08" dur="4.72">young children there so it&amp;#39;ll be nice.</text><text start="16.08" dur="5.199">First lady and myself. We give out candy</text><text start="18.8" dur="4.96">and things. But we have a beautiful</text><text start="21.279" dur="4.16">Halloween and I believe this big</text><text start="23.76" dur="3.92">beautiful plane&amp;#39;s going to make a quick</text><text start="25.439" dur="4.401">little flight right over the center and</text><text start="27.68" dur="3.519">entertain the children. and it&amp;#39;ll be a</text><text start="29.84" dur="4.16">lot of fun. So hopefully you&amp;#39;ll be</text><text start="31.199" dur="4.561">there.</text><text start="34" dur="3.2">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Say it.</text><text start="35.76" dur="2.72">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Because I think he&amp;#39;s doing well. We&amp;#39;re</text><text start="37.2" dur="2.24">going to do a teller rally for him</text><text start="38.48" dur="2.56">instead.</text><text start="39.44" dur="3.119">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; He&amp;#39;s doing He&amp;#39;s doing very well</text><text start="41.04" dur="2.72">actually.</text><text start="42.559" dur="1.84">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; At the golf course.</text><text start="43.76" dur="2.479">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Who is what?</text><text start="44.399" dur="4.561">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Who was at the golf course?</text><text start="46.239" dur="5.201">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Oh, many people. You mean uh are you</text><text start="48.96" dur="4.16">talking about the one over here? Yeah.</text><text start="51.44" dur="3.68">Many people. It&amp;#39;s very dangerous because</text><text start="53.12" dur="4.16">the holes are too. It&amp;#39;s a very obsolete</text><text start="55.12" dur="3.919">course and we&amp;#39;re doing very well. We&amp;#39;re</text><text start="57.28" dur="3.599">going to have something great for the</text><text start="59.039" dur="3.921">country.</text><text start="60.879" dur="4.32">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; We&amp;#39;ll have top tournaments here. Yeah.</text><text start="62.96" dur="4.08">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Mr. President, you&amp;#39;ve been doing a lot</text><text start="65.199" dur="3.761">of travel. We&amp;#39;ve been doing a lot of</text><text start="67.04" dur="2.64">travel with you. How are you feeling?</text><text start="68.96" dur="2.56">How&amp;#39;s your health?</text><text start="69.68" dur="4.24">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Good. I think very good. I think you see</text><text start="71.52" dur="5.84">that we had a great rally. That was a</text><text start="73.92" dur="5.68">great rally. And I think that uh</text><text start="77.36" dur="4">Darlene&amp;#39;s going to do very well. I think</text><text start="79.6" dur="3.519">we&amp;#39;re all going to do very well. Think</text><text start="81.36" dur="3.119">think you&amp;#39;re going to have some very</text><text start="83.119" dur="3.521">We&amp;#39;re going to have a strong Tuesday</text><text start="84.479" dur="3.921">night. That&amp;#39;s my opinion. So you not</text><text start="86.64" dur="2.799">going to Kansas has nothing to do with</text><text start="88.4" dur="2.96">you being sick of traveling?</text><text start="89.439" dur="3.761">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Oh, you&amp;#39;re sick to ask that question.</text><text start="91.36" dur="2.96">You are sick. Who you with?</text><text start="93.2" dur="3.12">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; I&amp;#39;m with Reuters, sir.</text><text start="94.32" dur="3.6">&amp;gt;&amp;gt; You are a sick guy. Reuters is terrible,</text><text start="96.32" dur="3.28">by the way. Can you imagine? Look at</text><text start="97.92" dur="4.4">this. Look at this guy. He&amp;#39;s way out of</text><text start="99.6" dur="4.72">shape. Look at how badly. He comes to</text><text start="102.32" dur="3.68">me. Sir, you&amp;#39;re not going to go to</text><text start="104.32" dur="3.28">Kansas. I&amp;#39;m not going to Kansas because</text><text start="106" dur="3.439">he&amp;#39;s doing very well. I&amp;#39;m going to do a</text><text start="107.6" dur="4.24">teller rally tomorrow. I&amp;#39;m doing</text><text start="109.439" dur="5.441">Florida. He said, &amp;quot;What&amp;#39;s the reason?&amp;quot;</text><text start="111.84" dur="5.04">After doing what? 28. He says, &amp;quot;What&amp;#39;s</text><text start="114.88" dur="3.599">the reason for this, sir, that you&amp;#39;re</text><text start="116.88" dur="3.68">not going to Kansas? You know what the</text><text start="118.479" dur="4.881">reason is? I don&amp;#39;t feel I have to go to</text><text start="120.56" dur="5.36">Kansas. I&amp;#39;m going to Florida tomorrow</text><text start="123.36" dur="4.879">and I&amp;#39;ll do if something else comes up.&amp;quot;</text><text start="125.92" dur="4.959">But he said, &amp;quot;You&amp;#39;re not going to</text><text start="128.239" dur="4.881">Kansas, sir. Are you feeling well?</text><text start="130.879" dur="5.36">You&amp;#39;ve been following me for two weeks.</text><text start="133.12" dur="5.119">I feel perfect. You are disgusting. Put</text><text start="136.239" dur="3.681">yourself in shape. You look like hell.&amp;quot;</text><text start="138.239" dur="4.241">Thank you, Mr. President. to breathe</text><text start="139.92" dur="2.56">yesterday.</text></transcript>